From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LIMInGZE666 <LIMInGZE666@noreply.gitcode.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Sep 2026 22:17:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] OHOS: relax the Wayland minimum from 1.24 to 1.22

The ohpcd ecosystem pins wayland/1.22.0 (qtbase/6.11.1.2 and
qtwayland/6.11.1 both require it; mixing 1.24.0 is a graph conflict,
libkscreen 6.7.2 precedent). kwayland only uses the stable Wayland
client API that 1.22 already provides.

---
 CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@
     find_package(Qt6WaylandClientPrivate ${REQUIRED_QT_VERSION} REQUIRED NO_MODULE)
 endif()

-find_package(Wayland 1.24 COMPONENTS Client)
+find_package(Wayland 1.22 COMPONENTS Client)
 set_package_properties(Wayland PROPERTIES
                        TYPE REQUIRED
                       )
--
